      "source": "https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dcnr/recreation/where-to-go/state-parks/find-a-park/pymatuning-state-park/history",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Great Pymatuning Swamp once covered the region; glaciers melted and filled the area with sediments, creating the swamp that later became the reservoir.",
